.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH HOSTNAME 1 "2026-09-01"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
hostname \- Display or set the system\*(Aqs host name.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBhostname\fR [OPTION]... [HOSTNAME]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Display or set the system\*(Aqs host name.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-domain\fR
Display the name of the DNS domain if possible
.TP
\fB\-i\fR, \fB\-\-ip\-address\fR
Display the network address(es) of the host
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-fqdn\fR
Display the FQDN (Fully Qualified Domain Name) (default)
.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-short\fR
Display the short hostname (the portion before the first dot) if possible
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
[\fIhost\fR]

.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v(uutils coreutils) 0.11.0
